<title>GERMANY: NORDIC SKIING-LEADING WORLD CUP COMBINED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-LEADING WORLD CUP COMBINED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SCHONACH, Germany 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in a Nordic</p>
